CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/n/a com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/trigger/MapTrigger
	COMMENT MapTrigger - one trigger block of a map (parsed by TriggerLoader). Named fields, each verified from the assignment in TriggerLoader.a(TriggerEngine, GroupObject): name (the Tiled object's name), id ("id" property, defaults to the object name), uniqueId (id plus "_N" when duplicates exist), type (TriggerType from the object's "type"), sourceObject (the Tiled GroupObject providing read-only properties), activationList (TriggerList of activation conditions), elements (the TriggerElements, e.g. UnitDetectElement / TeamTagDetectElement), allToActivate ("allToActivate"), delay ("delay"), repeatDelay ("repeatDelay"), repeatCount ("repeatCount"), resetActivationAfter ("resetActivationAfter"), warmup ("warmup"), team ("team"), text ("text", only for mapText/objective), globalMessage ("globalMessage"), textOffsetX/textOffsetY ("textOffsetX"/"textOffsetY"), textPaint (the Paint built for mapText: textColor/textSize, bold) and drawArrow ("style"=arrow), plus runtime delayPassed and activationStartTime. Still obfuscated (no assignment evidence): e (second TriggerList), i, j, u (booleans) and k, l (ints). [field names verified from the ini/trigger parser]
	FIELD a name Ljava/lang/String;
	FIELD A globalMessage Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bb;
